        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 162,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc007/source-page-0162.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 163",
          "anchor_preview": "右闪乳者，乳从偏落，闪在一旁，故为之闪。如小儿闪躲之义，即乳体之变格也。龙势到此起顶，偏下作穴，而中出之乳粗硬斜曲，无穴可下，正气闪在一边，乃以中乳为龙虎护卫之沙，此穴极为难认。龙从左来，闪乳在右；龙",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc007\\source-page-0162.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 488203,
          "asset_sha256": "f96afe51d7c7d88f63ed5146d3d5a5192fea697b0c680bdea3a8524d5f243ef5",
          "reference_count": 1
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 212,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc007/source-page-0212.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 213",
          "anchor_preview": "《指南》云“凡地起顶垂乳，又有两臂作龙虎者，便以人形取之，下咽喉、肩井等穴。若无两臂，但作小坡钳之类，即以手诀取之，下大指根，及点塩指根，并虎口中等法，所谓“有臂盘环只象人，无臂手中分”者是也。今将指",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc007\\source-page-0212.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 607663,
          "asset_sha256": "bc4b37c6397259be75a912769c58de237722193458e853cf0e9968aa4a1f8842",
          "reference_count": 1
        },
