        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 225,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc007/source-page-0225.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 226",
          "anchor_preview": "右二十四位杀穴：颈长者，来弱也；翅短者，无包藏也；贯顶者，无主星也；绷面者，生气杀也；若如死鳖者，阴阳不分也；坠足者，后轻前重也；童头者，躁秃无生气也；竹篙、摇拳者，直杀也；水现、瓮弦、空窝者，无顶乳",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc007\\source-page-0225.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 557062,
          "asset_sha256": "92eb64281710ce444fb7df14c683c66f129ed5bd5beeb0b91278e5583c3330a0",
