        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 82,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0082.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 83",
          "anchor_preview": "此以下五卷，专论水法。夫天一生水，水实万物之祖。水在天地间为最多，四海五湖，特其概耳。浴日月，浸乾坤，皆水之效灵者也。故水于阴阳家，曰山水，曰风水，水居其半，可谓重矣。而地书乃以水居四科之末，似以水为",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc009\\source-page-0082.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 494688,
          "asset_sha256": "ff4ea79cc51f11717ebc058181431a334e737cbbf2111925a70d1906e69d54ab",
          "reference_count": 1
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 86,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0086.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 87",
          "anchor_preview": "夜，谓其侄曰：“吾老矣，无子。田产家业皆汝所有，门户应汝值之。”其侄忤之，因相诟。侄自谓己业倍叔，叔业任与人无悔。于是投汪氏。时已夜半，汪睡醒，敲其门。汪起纳之。其人尽以田产家业契付汪氏，因而骤富，果",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc009\\source-page-0086.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 713480,
          "asset_sha256": "e2b6fef41151ca7370e5c370ef32f1f9aa3dc8ebbbbb58d19a76659d16a51327",
          "reference_count": 1
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 90,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0090.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 91",
          "anchor_preview": "落平洋，铺毡展席，隐隐隆隆，分牙布爪。比入局，开平田大帐，束气结咽，成银锭脉，为平中一突泛水文星。左右面前三湖汪洋巨浸。近有玉带砂低伏弯抱，以关内气。远有文笔峰秀贴天表，以为贵证。明堂宽广，四势和平。",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc009\\source-page-0090.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 633513,
          "asset_sha256": "3eef488d60cfac117a499055c871f92284f5d092a5c751d5ba038b2c1e60a5b4",
          "reference_count": 1
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 104,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0104.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 106",
          "anchor_preview": "上明堂吉格，岂止于斯？姑辑数者以为式耳。大抵明堂之吉，举目之间，形势自然可爱，气象自然可观。《葬书》所谓“天光发新，朝海拱辰”，斯为妙矣。",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc009\\source-page-0104.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 575839,
          "asset_sha256": "fa76df72693d0f7e34b5c9aa705e851ce9fcca36d08b1b30caac06a7bfb43d99",
          "reference_count": 1
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 105,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0105.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 106",
          "anchor_preview": "上明堂吉格，岂止于斯？姑辑数者以为式耳。大抵明堂之吉，举目之间，形势自然可爱，气象自然可观。《葬书》所谓“天光发新，朝海拱辰”，斯为妙矣。",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc009\\source-page-0105.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 460853,
          "asset_sha256": "208f8263ff6c2873d6c1affceef97948007e8935c47eb7f74c45644e9c080cef",
          "reference_count": 1
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 106,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0106.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 108",
          "anchor_preview": "上明堂凶格，亦不止此，举此为式，可以类推。大要多见古格，自能心悟，吉凶祸福，举目洞知，又不在于笔舌所悉。但明堂管初年祸福，关系最紧，务要审择，不可忽也。",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc009\\source-page-0106.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 500691,
          "asset_sha256": "4f33032479cb7e39b1482ab3d72d6cf14b0bceb1f8c5ac51b62353109ef7cba6",
          "reference_count": 1
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 107,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0107.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 108",
          "anchor_preview": "上明堂凶格，亦不止此，举此为式，可以类推。大要多见古格，自能心悟，吉凶祸福，举目洞知，又不在于笔舌所悉。但明堂管初年祸福，关系最紧，务要审择，不可忽也。",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc009\\source-page-0107.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 483174,
          "asset_sha256": "3997786ad2e53e2035f94e1079aded050a6659a46d3c57fb027d99b4bc532d4f",
          "reference_count": 1
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 112,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0112.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 113",
          "anchor_preview": "朝怀者，当面对朝也。此水易发，主朝贫暮富。予尝谓“逆砂一尺可致富，朝水一杓能救贫。”然朝水不但发财而已，且能致贵。杨公云：“大水洋洋对面朝，列土更分茅。”青乌云：“大水洋朝，无上之贵。",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc009\\source-page-0112.jpg",
          "asset_bytes": 327009,
          "asset_sha256": "2b6c8283d4e8ad2bcb425cc42c7c595669923561c86b79f4d75e27c5617dae2c",
          "reference_count": 1
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 178,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0178.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 180",
          "anchor_preview": "右吉奇诸局，出《素书》，取三奇之方，四吉之位，子、父、财、官之宫，山水相映则吉。",
          "asset": "D:\\壮五福\\风水项目\\Md\\精校版\\assets\\book018\\doc009\\source-page-0178.jpg",
